=ed6c7de7739c20f34f4f8017905ff361", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/938a4e5d/uploads/origins/dac6488e-b28a-4805-b5b9-9c4b31950db9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed6c7de7739c20f34f4f8017905ff361, https://si.imgix.net/938a4e5d/uploads/origins/dac6488e-b28a-4805-b5b9-9c4b31950db9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=356f753b12e2b6db6b358f4df4cc913a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/938a4e5d/uploads/origins/dac6488e-b28a-4805-b5b9-9c4b31950db9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad8419f960c8c755f7b5d335e8022752 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、ゆうちゃんあなたの絵はとても表情豊かで美しいので、とても気に入っています。\n私の新しいポケモントレーナーの絵をお願いしたいのですが、ポーズや表情はおまかせしたいです最初はフエコ（ホゲタ）を持っていたので、それをなんとか取り入れたいです\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/13bpWSHzLVAWr6IP-s4yyIHg31fVNna_c/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nattiepeach1/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ef15c184/uploads/origins/d1a35f18-71dc-4162-82a0-e571e29065bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=442615ef5c968b0334dff5ef8cf55de9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ef15c184/uploads/origins/d1a35f18-71dc-4162-82a0-e571e29065bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=442615ef5c968b0334dff5ef8cf55de9, https://si.imgix.net/ef15c184/uploads/origins/d1a35f18-71dc-4162-82a0-e571e29065bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26bb1d20ba8cd64ca028bde601c8dd10 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ef15c184/uploads/origins/d1a35f18-71dc-4162-82a0-e571e29065bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed67e6ee625245568519e26238134bce 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!! I'd like to request an illustration with a simple background for my OC here:\n◇https://toyhou.se/18680931.tbn\n\nHe is a modern day witch, a model, social influencer and a very charismatic and popular young man^^ he has a lot of attitude, a fun personality and is very free spirited! He is a fairly feminine boy.\n\nHis magic looks like purple dust or smoke! He can also float if that gives you more ideas>:D Please draw a version with and without his witch hat^^\n\nComposition and pose is up to you! I'd like for this piece to show off his playful and mischievous side if possible:3 hes very caluclative and witty despite how carefree he is. Please have fun with his character! I'd like a city/urban background or something similar!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nattiepeach1/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/952121c3/uploads/origins/b6ccc789-c296-4b9d-8a50-58c0c24057c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68828b0c00f4bf70e493363ac3168d40", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/952121c3/uploads/origins/b6ccc789-c296-4b9d-8a50-58c0c24057c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68828b0c00f4bf70e493363ac3168d40, https://si.imgix.net/952121c3/uploads/origins/b6ccc789-c296-4b9d-8a50-58c0c24057c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4438ca6a1535e1aa356fc5ae4c45e083 2x, https://si.imgix.net/952121c3/uploads/origins/b6ccc789-c296-4b9d-8a50-58c0c24057c0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c3191511ed6c92a55c6a7c003d69ee6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして。あなたの絵がとても好きで、私のOCのために一枚お願いしたいのです。\n\n彼女は騎士ですが、カタナを使い、勇ましく、優雅です。\n\n変更等ありましたら、お気軽にお申し付けください。この度はありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/XSl0A2k", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nattiepeach1/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/545e90ca/uploads/origins/0300354f-a3b7-4c74-80b6-f428b636c3ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef9644e1c87a19de8522ab2f66b270b4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/545e90ca/uploa